info.json, with a website only where the README names a live site.

scripts/readme/update_readme.py reads the same file for the root README
project table: about over the hard-coded DESCRIPTIONS and the README text,
and website when the README has no Live Site line. Four DESCRIPTIONS entries
it replaces are gone; the coderabbit one was wrong (that folder only has a
license).

blt-cron/logo.svg: a clock on the red disc, 358 bytes, in the same style and
colour (#dc2626) as the other project logos, also shown at the top of its
README.

